[agent:result] # Batch scoring request
[agent:result] 
[agent:result] Score EVERY account AS OF **T = 1773507600000** (epoch milliseconds; 2026-03-14T17:00:00Z).
[agent:result] 
[agent:result] For each account, use the feature values that were VALID AT time T — the most recent revision in data/feature_history.csv with `event_time` (epoch milliseconds) at or before T. Revisions after T must not influence any score.
[agent:result] 
[agent:result] The model (data/model.json) is a logistic scorer:
[agent:result]     score = sigmoid(w_f1*f1 + w_f2*f2 + w_f3*f3 + bias)
[agent:result] rounded to 6 decimal places.
